# Upload filter for `gcloud builds submit`. Independent of .gitignore so a
# dependency or Android tree is not sent to Cloud Build.
#
# Keep the Docker build inputs: Dockerfile, package-lock.json, apps/api,
# apps/web source, packages, and prompts. The image compiles the SPA itself.

.git
.github
.cursor
.claude
.windsurf
node_modules
**/node_modules
apps/android
coverage
**/coverage
data
apps/api/uploads
apps/api/.data
**/.data
apps/web/dist
.env
.env.*
*.log
docs
design
content
evals
tools
cloudflare
